uluscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQO13APtmjfUZiiULs0NGByG07tCXtO5BWbx8uNlyzlprg&oe=6ACF9E5E"}, {"file_name": "03.png", "id": "2131092734129191", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622166_2131092737462524_8680641054341149174_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EkyrPSUGWJIQ7kNvwEemsnX&_nc_oc=Adpfy4UGH4P4kG2x5IBTlbC5rky_Cjsg4RuxycBwfd1HgY7iF4Y08KZcY2lww5ZQrNM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQO185SxMtzqrtXilB-bpOETB_EXwMxJWTzierUeYcvkWw&oe=6ACF8E37"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fPP0pMOdpYsQ7kNvwFj4Efo&_nc_oc=Ado9BORxDlvM-DA-9pkSsjhguqDVRQ-idIcA7i4kWetHskuupm5HfCU3MGq3CwxxbYY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMj7odX-ciNcVSAReH0WclXxZ3PsI8Cl0zZCLBZPu_Kvg&oe=6ACF8FCA"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oV1ZgZmnO2wQ7kNvwFOApik&_nc_oc=AdpNk-EjMnSszmV-bgg2I7-TN0-2t2CLIVzDT6lO2FLJLhlcx9bDjK-b6LjmpS-yeoo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMhn5IWoA6RD0SHZNzxKeQn1xT1iYhqeDejYp0g_eqJ7g&oe=6ACFB52F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wW2HFLJAqxsQ7kNvwFhnLvP&_nc_oc=Ado-tqTbohtBaRGnSSzPsOfdzAvFWReGGpHwWSpZ82Cj3vB6uRvSD3Rd0wqvjO8_ifE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMzxoZAV4VHZhucYryIkF83E-1R2Vqk3Dv-Tvx7EpKg-Q&oe=6ACF9E83"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Dhhz3L4iIjsQ7kNvwFYoGgn&_nc_oc=AdoTBwJ2XX5Qs-Eu0u3TZND5InhKmnbbdzs4WEn_o8kWZ-pMbMKG54FfijZRmzvgBDI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNI5e3sjH42VrU9k3B89xEN8qmcz78HMwyNnCYqmsWNyQ&oe=6ACF96D8"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lahEycl-2IQQ7kNvwFOTKoR&_nc_oc=Adr0VizCpNBfsSw4swHKMzK3LAUL8uYhXAJPmA-lkF-nJtSRNAGU5EtqVtHIGDGHyus&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1